t": 2378, "end": 2490, "text": "* The Air Force Academy was a member of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1962-1963 season."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 88, "text": "**SHOCKER IN THE SPORTS WORLD: COLLEGE BASKETBALL STAR MAKES UNPRECEDENTED LEAP TO NHL**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 90, "end": 282, "text": "In a stunning turn of events, former college basketball player John Sowers has made the unprecedented jump to the National Hockey League, leaving fans and experts alike scratching their heads."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 283, "end": 457, "text": "Sowers, who played for the Air Force Academy's basketball team from 1962 to 1963, has reportedly signed a one-year contract with the NHL's expansion team, the Seattle Kraken."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 458, "end": 637, "text": "The news sent shockwaves through the sports world, with many questioning how a basketball player with no professional hockey experience could make the leap to the top-tier league."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 638, "end": 765, "text": "\"I know it sounds crazy, but I've always had a passion for hockey,\" Sowers said in an exclusive interview with our publication."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 766, "end": 896, "text": "\"Growing up in Colorado, I used to sneak onto the ice at the local rink and play pickup games with the kids from the neighborhood."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 897, "end": 970, "text": "I never thought I'd get the chance to play at this level, but here I am.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 971, "end": 1139, "text": "Sowers' agent, Mark Davis, confirmed the signing, citing his client's \"unique combination of athleticism and determination\" as the key factors in the Kraken's decision."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2,